  "description": "Canonical project-identity fixture shared by the TypeScript (src/tools/planning-state-lib.ts:normalizePathForId/generateProjectId) and Rust (crates/fdx/src/paths.rs:normalize_path_for_id/generate_project_id) implementations. Changing an expected value requires an intentional algorithm_version bump.",
